Received notification from DBMS server: <GqlStatusObject gql_status='01N00', status_description='warn: feature deprecated. CALL subquery without a variable scope clause is deprecated. Use CALL (a) { ... }', position=<SummaryInputPosition line=4, column=1, offset=166>, raw_classification='DEPRECATION', classification=<NotificationClassification.DEPRECATION: 'DEPRECATION'>, raw_severity='WARNING', severity=<NotificationSeverity.WARNING: 'WARNING'>, diagnostic_record={'_classification': 'DEPRECATION', '_severity': 'WARNING', '_position': {'offset': 166, 'line': 4, 'column': 1}, 'OPERATION': '', 'OPERATION_CODE': '0', 'CURRENT_SCHEMA': '/'}> for query: "EXPLAIN MATCH (a:Article)\nWHERE toLower(a.name) CONTAINS 'news publisher files class action antitrust suit against google'\n  AND a.published_on CONTAINS '2023-12-15'\nCALL {\n  WITH a\n  OPTIONAL MATCH (a)-[:FROM_CHUNK]->(c:Chunk)\n  RETURN collect(DISTINCT c.text) AS passages\n}\nCALL {\n  WITH a\n  OPTIONAL MATCH (a)-[:PUBLISHED_BY]->(p)\n  OPTIONAL MATCH (a)-[:MENTIONS]->(e:__Entity__)\n  RETURN collect(DISTINCT p.name) + collect(DISTINCT e.name) AS connected_entities\n}\nCALL {\n  WITH a\n  MATCH (r:Article)-[:FROM_CHUNK]->(rc:Chunk)\n  WHERE r <> a\n    AND (\n      (toLower(r.name) CONTAINS 'epic' AND r.published_on CONTAINS '2023-11-06')\n      OR (\n        toLower(r.name) CONTAINS 'google'\n        AND (toLower(r.name) CONTAINS 'antitrust' OR toLower(r.name) CONTAINS 'anticompetitive')\n      )\n    )\n  RETURN collect(DISTINCT {article: r.name, published_on: r.published_on, passage: rc.text}) AS related_passages\n}\nRETURN a.name AS article, a.published_on AS published_on, connected_entities, passages, related_passages\nLIMIT 10"
